  "description": "The TK1 Fat Tire Electric Trike has been replaced by the FT1 Fat Tire Electric Trike\nThe FT1 is the direct successor to the TK1 Fat Tire. It carries the same 20\" × 4.0 fat tires and folding frame, with a longer range, a 7-speed drivetrain and an upgraded battery. The TK1 Fat Tire is no longer available to order.\nSee the FT1 Fat Tire Electric Trike → Compare all electric trikes\nThe TK1 Fat Tire Electric Trike offers a range of 30-45 miles and a weight capacity of 400 lbs. Equipped with 20\" x 4.0 wide tires, it provides stability, safety, and versatility on almost any terrain, from city streets to rugged trails, making it ready for any adventure you want to take on.",
